@InfoExchange_HostAddress = http://localhost:5160

### Requests reference letter for patient 12345.
GET {{InfoExchange_HostAddress}}/12345/referenceletter

### Requests reference letter for patient 54321.
GET {{InfoExchange_HostAddress}}/54321/referenceletter

### Requests reference letter for patient 67890.
### This request should fail; The file does not exist.
GET {{InfoExchange_HostAddress}}/67890/referenceletter

### Requests allergies information file for patient 12345.
GET {{InfoExchange_HostAddress}}/12345/allergies

### Requests medication usage file for patient 54321.
GET {{InfoExchange_HostAddress}}/54321/meds

### Requests allergies information file for patient 54321.
### This request should fail; The file does not exist.
GET {{InfoExchange_HostAddress}}/54321/allergies